  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hunger Safety Net Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce poverty, hunger and vulnerability by providing the poorest households in Kenya&apos;s arid and semi-arid lands with cash transfers. This contributes to our MDGs by preventing 720,000 people from becoming poorer and help them to increase their expenditure on food, health, education and wider livelihood opportunities by 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
